  (text "Schematic and Board Review:\n\nSchematic:\n- I suspect drive selector keying is reversed. Please check with the board itself\n\nBoard:\n- Thickened up the power traces a little to 1.5mm, reduced via count\n- Copper GND pour clearance must not be 0 since it will default to minimum\n  clearance, which is the absolute minimum the board manufacturer can do\n  In general use 0.5mm for GND pour clearance"
